<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <PackageId>BulletMLLib</PackageId>
    <Version>5.1.0</Version>
    <Title>BulletMLLib</Title>
    <Authors>dmanning23</Authors>
    <description>Library for parsing BulletML xml files. Used for scripting bullet patterns in shmup games.</description>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/dmanning23/BulletMLLib</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/dmanning23/BulletMLLib</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>monogame</PackageTags>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
5.1.0

BREAKING: patterns are now validated against the BulletML DTD rules, so some patterns that loaded in 5.0 will throw from ParseXML. Errors are InvalidDataException, wrapped in an exception naming the file.
- Elements in places the DTD doesn't allow are rejected.
- Required children are enforced: changeSpeed needs speed and term, changeDirection needs direction and term, accel needs term, repeat needs times plus an action or actionRef.
- Invalid, misspelled or misplaced type attributes are rejected. A direction with a bad type is no longer silently treated as aim.
- actionRef, bulletRef and fireRef must have a label.
- BulletPattern.MyValidationEventHandler has been removed.

Fixed:
- Bullets that fire themselves (recursive bulletRef) no longer crash with a stack overflow.
- Circular actionRef chains are reported as an error instead of overflowing the stack.
- A fire node with no bullet or bulletRef reports which node is broken, instead of throwing a NullReferenceException.
- speed, horizontal and vertical now default to absolute, as the spec says.

Full release notes: https://github.com/dmanning23/BulletMLLib/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="../README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="MonoGame.Framework.DesktopGL" Version="3.8.*">
      <PrivateAssets>All</PrivateAssets>
    </PackageReference>
    <PackageReference Include="Vector2Extensions" Version="5.*"/>
    <PackageReference Include="Equationator" Version="5.*"/>
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>